d only diagonally... Here red is a 2x2 block, fine. Vertical alignment shifts.\n\nAlso note: shifts happen; could objects overlap? Here red moves into rows 2-3 which are currently occupied by nothing at cols 2-3 (blue at cols 4-5, yellow at 0-1). Fine.\n\nSubmit prediction.",
